"""Live Face Recognition Pipeline (Webcam -> YuNet -> Liveness -> ArcFace -> Attendance & Unknown Capture).

=============================================================================
LIVE PRODUCTION ATTENDANCE & RECOGNITION PIPELINE
=============================================================================
This script runs live webcam face recognition with end-to-end integration:
1. Dynamically loads all registered employee embeddings from data/employees.json.
2. Checks temporal 3D liveness before recognition to prevent photo/screen spoofing.
3. ArcFace 512-D embedding extraction with cosine similarity matching against all employees.
4. If similarity >= threshold (0.65):
   - Sets status to RECOGNIZED: <EmployeeId>
   - Calls backend Attendance API (POST http://localhost:3000/api/attendance) to record PRESENT
   - HUD turns GREEN with candidate identity and attendance confirmation
5. If similarity < threshold (< 0.65):
   - Sets status to UNKNOWN FACE
   - Saves face crop to data/unknown/unknown_<timestamp>.jpg
   - Calls Unknown Faces API (POST http://localhost:3000/api/face-enrollments/capture-unknown)
     to log photo & timestamp on the frontend Unknown Faces dashboard
   - HUD turns RED
=============================================================================
"""

